\fs50 \cf2 \
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa100\partightenfactor0
\ls1\ilvl0\cf2 \cb3 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Deploy an Amazon RDS MySQL database instance with Multi-AZ configuration.\cb1 \
\ls1\ilvl0\cb3 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Establish secure connectivity between Amazon EC2 and Amazon RDS.\cb1 \
\ls1\ilvl0\cb3 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Create and manage database objects in RDS MySQL.\cb1 \
\ls1\ilvl0\cb3 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Implement and verify Multi-AZ failover procedures.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
